      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>cinder</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Represents a cinder volume resource in Openstack. A Cinder volume must exist before mounting to a container. The volume must also be in the same region as the kubelet. Cinder volumes support ownership management and SELinux relabeling.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>claimRef</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
