      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>quobyte</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Represents a Quobyte mount that lasts the lifetime of a pod. Quobyte volumes do not support ownership management or SELinux relabeling.</TableCell>
