      <h3 id="_spechostpath" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.hostPath<a href="#_spechostpath" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Represents a host path mapped into a pod. Host path volumes do not support ownership management or SELinux relabeling.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Required</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><ul><li><code>path</code></li></ul></dd>
      </dl>
